{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Puṇṇa (2nd)","html":"<article id='thag1.70'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Theragāthā 1.70 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Monks 1.70 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Sattamavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Chapter Seven </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Puṇṇattheragāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Puṇṇa (2nd) </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Sīlameva idha aggaṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Ethical conduct is best in this life, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>paññavā pana uttamo; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>but one with wisdom is supreme. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Manussesu ca devesu, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Someone with both virtue and wisdom </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sīlapaññāṇato jayan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>is victorious among men and gods. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Puṇṇo thero … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>vaggo sattamo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Tassuddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Vappo ca vajjiputto ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>pakkho vimalakoṇḍañño; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ukkhepakatavaccho ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>meghiyo ekadhammiko; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ekudāniyachannā ca, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>puṇṇatthero mahabbaloti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote></article>"}
